p.src:
Restoring the speed of light gives the dimensional form $\frac{\partial\psi_R}{\partial x}
+
\frac{1}{c}\frac{\partial\psi_R}{\partial t}
=0,$ so that $\omega=ck.$ From now on $c=1$. With $\hbar=1$, $\omega$ is also the energy of one quantum.

